From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:30:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] headless-egl

A HeadlessSurface for Linux: a GLES2 pbuffer on Mesa's surfaceless EGL
platform, so the render and retro-shader tests run on a Linux box with
no display, under GLES2 like the device. Our own render test files in
slot-gfx and slot-ui widen their cfg to Linux; upstream's stay macOS
only. A guard test fails when the context is not real GLES, so a
missing driver cannot pass the others vacuously. After
cloudwithax/unslot 42ef0f8 (GPL-3.0),
https://github.com/cloudwithax/unslot/commit/42ef0f8, and
suprsomething/slot.advance e761baa (GPL-3.0),
https://github.com/suprsomething/slot.advance/commit/e761baa
